  "id": "invoice-by-hand",
  "after": "selfCheck",
  "title": "Work out the invoice by hand first.",
  "caption": "Before you test `invoice_total`, work out one small case on paper. Here we assume 18% GST on both items. If your function returns the same three numbers, your loop is right.",
  "alt": "The test data items = [(\"pen drive\", 500, 2), (\"mouse\", 400, 1)]. A table: pen drive, ₹500, quantity 2, ₹1,000; mouse, ₹400, quantity 1, ₹400. Subtotal ₹1,400. GST at 18%, 1,400 × 0.18, is ₹252. Grand total ₹1,652. Below, the code idea: subtotal = 0; for name, price, qty in items: subtotal += price * qty; gst = subtotal * gst_rate. The function should return 1400, 252.0, 1652.0.",
  "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 360 382\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"344\" height=\"54\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-surface2\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"29\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:13px\">items = [(\"pen drive\", 500, 2),</text><text x=\"88.2\" y=\"50\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:13px\">(\"mouse\", 400, 1)]</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\">Item</text><text x=\"178\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">Price</text><text x=\"226\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">Qty</text><text x=\"344\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"f-muted\" text-anchor=\"end\">Price × Qty</text><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"352\" y2=\"92\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"14\">pen drive</text><text x=\"178\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\">₹500</text><text x=\"226\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\">2</text><text x=\"344\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\">₹1,000</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"14\">mouse</text><text x=\"178\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\">₹400</text><text x=\"226\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\">1</text><text x=\"344\" y=\"138\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\">₹400</text><line x1=\"8\" y1=\"146\" x2=\"352\" y2=\"146\" class=\"s-line\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"14\">Subtotal</text><text x=\"344\" y=\"168\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"600\">₹1,400</text><text x=\"14\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"14\">GST at 18%: 1,400 × 0.18</text><text x=\"344\" y=\"192\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"600\">₹252</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"202\" width=\"344\" height=\"34\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-ok-soft s-ok\" stroke-width=\"1.4\"/><text x=\"14\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\">Grand total</text><text x=\"344\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-weight=\"700\">₹1,652</text><rect x=\"8\" y=\"250\" width=\"344\" height=\"96\" rx=\"8\" class=\"f-indigo-soft\"/><text x=\"18\" y=\"271\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:13px\">subtotal = 0</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:13px\">for name, price, qty in items:</text><text x=\"49.2\" y=\"313\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:13px\">subtotal += price * qty</text><text x=\"18\" y=\"334\" font-size=\"13\" class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:13px\">gst = subtotal * gst_rate</text><text x=\"12\" y=\"370\" font-size=\"13\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Your function should return <tspan class=\"mono\" style=\"font-size:13px\">1400, 252.0, 1652.0</tspan></text></svg>"
